<Project>
  <!--
    Makes the ZeroAllocGeneratedAccessibility MSBuild property visible to the bundled generator
    as build_property.ZeroAllocGeneratedAccessibility (see issue #193). The same property name
    is shared, unqualified, across every ZeroAlloc generator package:

      <PropertyGroup>
        <ZeroAllocGeneratedAccessibility>Internal</ZeroAllocGeneratedAccessibility>
      </PropertyGroup>

    Unset or "Public" (the default) leaves every generated entry point public, byte-identical to
    before #193. "Internal" emits the generated {Model}Validator classes, the options extension
    classes and the DI/ASP.NET Core glue internal for every annotated model, including a public
    one. Any other value is generator error ZV0019. See docs/advanced.md.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <CompilerVisibleProperty Include="ZeroAllocGeneratedAccessibility" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
